  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, due to the nature of the proposed use alongwith the proposed opening hours would result in a detrimental impact to the residential amenities of neighbouring properties, due to noise and general disturbance. The proposed development is therefore contrary to The National Planning Policy Framework (2021), policies D3(7) and (9) and D13(C) and (D) of The London Plan (2021) and policy DM1.C of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan 2013.",
    "Reason : 2 - Due to the lack of floorplans and the proposed opening hours, it has not been demonstrated to the satisfaction of The Local Planning Authority that the proposal has been designed to deter crime. The proposal is therefore contrary to the high quality design aspirations of The National Planning Policy Framework (2021), policy D11.C of The London Plan (2021) and policy DM1.A of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan 2013."
  ],
